    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="structllvm_1_1_incoming" kindref="compound">Incoming</ref> for lane maks phi as machine instruction, incoming register <computeroutput>Reg</computeroutput> and incoming block <computeroutput>Block</computeroutput> are taken from machine instruction. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><computeroutput>UpdatedReg</computeroutput> (if valid) is <computeroutput>Reg</computeroutput> lane mask merged with another lane mask. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
